//? Title: Toom-3: actual five products and exact coefficient interpolation
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Toom-3 replaces nine third-size products with five evaluations and exact
interpolation. Actual checked signed coefficient states expose the implemented+2
evaluation point and the Karatsuba/schoolbook crossovers beneath the original
decimal experiment.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

Write A=a0+a1*B+a2*B^2 with B=10^k, and similarly for the second operand.
Evaluate at0,1,-1,2,infinity. From products w0,w1,wm1,w2,winf obtain
c0=w0,c4=winf,c2=(w1+wm1)/2-c0-c4,s=(w1-wm1)/2,t=(w2-c0-4c2-16c4)/2,c3=(t-s)/3,c1=s-c3.
Recompose sum(cj*B^j) before decimal carry. The native implementation uses
coefficient polynomials with checked signed128 intermediates and verifies exact
divisibility; it does not silently truncate interpolation. Fixed crossover
asymptotic arithmetic is O(n^log3(5)), but default small inputs use Karatsuba
below48 and schoolbook below32.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/toom3_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/random/quality.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/toom3.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    a::ToomOptions o;
    o.toom_leaf = 3;
    o.karatsuba_leaf = 3;
    auto r = a::toom3_trace("123456", "789012", o);
    std::print("| actual postorder branch | depth | split | returned exact coefficients |\n| --- | ---: | " "---: | --- |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.steps)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | `{}` |\n", s.kind, s.depth, s.split,
                   s.result);
    const auto &root = r.steps.back();
    std::print("Actual products at0,1,-1,2,infinity `{}`; interpolated c0..c4 `{}`; decimal product {}.\n",
               root.products, root.interpolated, r.value);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0},
                         "Actual123456 times789012; explicit crossover3");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual Toom internal calls",
                                     r.toom_calls));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual product {}", r.value));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/toom3_tiny.svg");
}
```
